      [0mEmbedded submitted graphs share the same original input reference and matching is_changed token, effective prompt, models and sampling settings: 25 steps, CFG 1, Euler/simple, denoise 1; prompt refinement is off. Differences are the sampler seed and the inactive text-enhancer seed, not a different prompt or model. Editor exports also change post-run seed control from randomize to fixed, layout and input/link ordering; this is not a claim that all workflow bytes differ only by seed. Diffusion: qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors; encoder: qwen3vl_8b_int8_convrot.safetensors; VAE: qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors.[0m
    [36m</p>[39m
    [36m<p>[39m
      [0mThe reported KSampler failure was AttributeError: module 'os' has no attribute 'memfd_create', a cloud runtime boundary, not evidence that seed 42 is invalid. The retry produced an image; the root cause and any service fix remain unverified. Three successful PNGs plus one reported failure imply four attempted jobs from the user sequence, not authenticated cloud history. Job IDs, actual cloud runtime and cost, including the failed attempt, are unknown and not reconstructed.[0m
